# The change timeline ("What changed", Ctrl+Shift+H) and its settings page.
#
# A run is unelevated, so no journal is tailed: the first shot is the state every fresh install
# has — recording off, the banner saying so with its Settings button — and the rest show rows the
# seed wrote through the same repository the index helper writes through.
tree .
refresh
dialog changes 01-recording-off
settings history
shot 02-settings
settings close
changes-seed
dialog changes 03-seeded
theme light-plus
dialog changes 04-seeded-light
theme dark-plus
assert-not-launched
state
